OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fmostly dry with clear spells through
OL,7,Fthe evening and overnight. The odd
OL,8,Fshower remains possible in the north
OL,9,Fduring the evening. A cold frosty
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA mostly dry and cloudy day
OL,13,Fwith some bright or sunny intervals,
OL,14,Fthe best of these in the east. The odd
OL,15,Fshower possible over western areas of
OL,16,FCentral and Tayside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
