OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy Saturday with some showers,
OL,7,FCloudy Sunday with heavier outbreaks
OL,8,Fof rain which will likely continue
OL,9,Finto Monday before clearing later in
OL,10,Fthe day. Breezy at times. Less cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
